    "note": "Written for live-mix on cpp/kit. The shimmer effect as Brian Eno and Daniel Lanois used it (a pitch shifter recirculating through a long reverb), built as an eight-line feedback delay network with a four-head delay-line shifter in the feedback path; not a model of any unit."
